WEBVTT

00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:11.630
Are you awake, Arata?

00:00:13.550 --> 00:00:15.430
What happened to me?

00:00:15.930 --> 00:00:19.260
You collapsed on the street.
You don't remember?

00:00:19.930 --> 00:00:24.020
Oh, yeah. It was right after I met
with Governor Komiya...

00:00:24.140 --> 00:00:26.060
Did you perform a Mental Trace?

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:30.780
I told you not to do it
when I'm not there.

00:00:31.240 --> 00:00:33.240
So, what about Karina Komiya?

00:00:33.820 --> 00:00:36.410
She wasn't involved
in Dr. Tsuchiya's death.

00:00:36.910 --> 00:00:37.620
And you?

00:00:38.030 --> 00:00:41.120
I met with a former Unit One inspector.

00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:43.620
Tokorozawa Correction Center

00:00:44.290 --> 00:00:47.880
Ex-Inspector Kira,
I believe you know this man?

00:00:49.250 --> 00:00:51.090
According to your case records,

00:00:51.510 --> 00:00:56.550
you and your partner, Inspector Fuse,
were investigating a smuggling case.

00:00:56.970 --> 00:01:00.970
Your suspect, however,
died in an unforeseen accident.

00:01:02.770 --> 00:01:03.390
Right.

00:01:04.140 --> 00:01:08.110
That man was the last person
the suspect met with.

00:01:08.900 --> 00:01:11.480
You investigated Koichi Azusawa?

00:01:12.110 --> 00:01:15.650
We couldn't connect him to the accident.

00:01:16.030 --> 00:01:19.570
After that, the two of you
were in a car accident as well.

00:01:20.330 --> 00:01:23.790
You were severely injured
and Inspector Fuse died.

00:01:24.450 --> 00:01:26.620
Records show maintenance errors...

00:01:26.790 --> 00:01:29.250
A fox did it.

00:01:30.130 --> 00:01:30.790
A fox?

00:01:31.630 --> 00:01:33.420
It's a lead Fuse found.

00:01:34.420 --> 00:01:37.880
A criminal syndicate whose members
can maintain their Hues.

00:01:38.970 --> 00:01:41.050
They call themselves "foxes."

00:01:42.350 --> 00:01:44.310
You think this man is one of them?

00:01:44.850 --> 00:01:47.270
We couldn't find anything.

00:01:48.520 --> 00:01:51.610
Please, don't ask any further.

00:01:57.150 --> 00:02:00.280
There are foxes
in the Public Safety Bureau, too.

00:02:06.410 --> 00:02:10.330
"Foxes." The Suppressing Action
Department officers used that word too.

00:02:11.340 --> 00:02:14.170
But we still don't know

00:02:14.630 --> 00:02:17.420
where Koichi Azusawa
fits into this puzzle.

00:02:18.590 --> 00:02:23.140
I checked his history. He's changed jobs
dozens of times in a short period.

00:02:23.600 --> 00:02:27.810
Current affiliations are unknown.
It's like he vanished into thin air.

00:02:28.690 --> 00:02:30.480
But he leaves tracks.

00:02:30.850 --> 00:02:34.150
In the memory of a former inspector,
for instance.

00:02:34.480 --> 00:02:35.650
I'll trace him and...

00:02:35.820 --> 00:02:38.150
Ow!

00:02:38.280 --> 00:02:40.490
Your intracranial pressure is elevated.

00:02:41.110 --> 00:02:42.950
No Mental Traces for now.

00:02:43.740 --> 00:02:46.240
There's no need to make a fuss.

00:02:47.870 --> 00:02:50.120
I'm just fine, Kei.

00:02:56.460 --> 00:02:59.670
Draw the knives
locked behind your eyelids.

00:02:59.840 --> 00:03:03.430
Reap the lives that grow into shackles.

00:03:03.550 --> 00:03:07.180
Even the lost memories that flee
once they're liberated and banished

00:03:07.310 --> 00:03:10.100
Are an everlasting cubism.

00:03:25.120 --> 00:03:30.910
Cause I know that in a future gone mad,

00:03:31.160 --> 00:03:34.630
Even nightmares are peaceful.

00:03:34.880 --> 00:03:36.710
RESET, RESET, yeah.

00:03:36.840 --> 00:03:40.720
The midnight sun
awakens and turns to a riot.

00:03:40.880 --> 00:03:45.140
A gun for a faux-friendly kiss.
A knife for a faux-revolutionary hug.

00:03:45.470 --> 00:03:51.600
Get rid of it all, even the frozen chains.

00:03:51.770 --> 00:03:55.480
Reality is always outside your head.

00:03:55.690 --> 00:04:00.070
In a world seen through bestial eyes,

00:04:00.360 --> 00:04:05.490
There is neither darkness nor light.

00:04:10.580 --> 00:04:13.920
Draw the knives
locked behind your eyelids.

00:04:14.040 --> 00:04:17.540
Reap the lives that grow into shackles.

00:04:17.670 --> 00:04:21.260
Even the false memories that flash before
your eyes impatiently and impulsively

00:04:21.420 --> 00:04:23.760
Are an everlasting cubism.

00:04:27.510 --> 00:04:30.810
#05
Agamemnon's Offering

00:04:34.520 --> 00:04:36.150
I'm back.

00:04:36.310 --> 00:04:39.650
Here, Obata dear. A souvenir from Dejima.

00:04:41.570 --> 00:04:42.780
I don't want it.

00:04:45.320 --> 00:04:46.410
Special Religious Zone Briefing

00:04:46.530 --> 00:04:49.280
So this Inspector's making his move next?

00:04:49.450 --> 00:04:51.830
And here I thought he hated games.

00:04:52.870 --> 00:04:54.710
Let's see what he can do.

00:05:02.050 --> 00:05:04.340
Why'd you give him the card?

00:05:04.930 --> 00:05:09.680
Remember how everyone suspected us
of the former inspectors' accident?

00:05:10.220 --> 00:05:14.350
I'm lending them a hand so they don't get
any weird ideas about us!

00:05:14.730 --> 00:05:16.520
You just don't get it.

00:05:17.560 --> 00:05:22.610
I don't think either of them would
suspect us just because we're enforcers.

00:05:22.940 --> 00:05:24.110
I wonder.

00:05:24.610 --> 00:05:28.950
You're free to wag your tail for them
all you like, but keep me out of it.

00:05:43.260 --> 00:05:45.880
Don't forget me

00:05:54.390 --> 00:05:56.810
No Special Religious Zone!

00:05:57.310 --> 00:05:59.020
No Special Religious Zone!

00:05:59.100 --> 00:06:00.520
Impeach Governor Komiya!

00:06:00.650 --> 00:06:02.980
Get out, immigrants!

00:06:03.110 --> 00:06:05.030
Immigrants will cloud our Hues!

00:06:06.320 --> 00:06:08.990
No Special Religious Zone!

00:06:09.110 --> 00:06:11.870
No Special Religious Zone!

00:06:11.990 --> 00:06:14.370
Get out, immigrants!

00:06:14.490 --> 00:06:16.750
Get out, immigrants!

00:06:16.870 --> 00:06:19.790
Mitake New Town
Special Religious Zone Briefing

00:06:20.330 --> 00:06:22.790
No Special Religious Zone!

00:06:23.460 --> 00:06:26.300
All drones in position.

00:06:26.920 --> 00:06:29.510
Thanks. Great work.

00:06:30.300 --> 00:06:35.100
I heard you were investigating
what happened to your predecessors.

00:06:35.520 --> 00:06:37.810
We've got nothing to show for it yet.

00:06:38.180 --> 00:06:39.390
I see.

00:06:42.690 --> 00:06:45.940
Just on security detail for the governor.
I'll bring Arata.

00:06:46.320 --> 00:06:49.530
Yes, we've got to perk him up.

00:06:50.660 --> 00:06:54.450
A "city for immigrants"?
Times sure have changed.

00:06:54.780 --> 00:06:58.290
Isn't the governor's Affirmation Party
anti-immigrant?

00:06:58.790 --> 00:07:02.960
Mitake New Town is a model for renewal
and a valuable constituency.

00:07:04.130 --> 00:07:07.590
It'll also act as relief
for the mortgage collapse.

00:07:08.170 --> 00:07:09.470
It can't be ignored.

00:07:09.970 --> 00:07:14.470
The time has finally come for this town
to be reborn as a special religious zone.

00:07:15.640 --> 00:07:18.480
All restrictions imposed
on proselytism

00:07:19.020 --> 00:07:23.480
and religious activities
will be lifted here.

00:07:23.980 --> 00:07:26.690
I'm so happy for all of you.

00:07:51.050 --> 00:07:52.260
"Happy."

00:07:53.010 --> 00:07:56.220
It's actually
an ingenious segregation policy.

00:07:56.550 --> 00:07:59.520
At least it's better
than ending up in the slums.

00:08:00.060 --> 00:08:05.860
I wouldn't mind. The slums offer order
for those with no place to belong.

00:08:05.980 --> 00:08:09.190
Do you plan to accept this
without protest?

00:08:09.570 --> 00:08:13.910
No. I will ignite myself if necessary.

00:08:14.410 --> 00:08:19.910
Forget self-immolation. Fire-fighting
drones are good at their jobs.

00:08:20.450 --> 00:08:22.910
Besides, it's not what Sibyl would want.

00:08:23.460 --> 00:08:27.920
We must prove that faith purifies the Hue.

00:08:30.590 --> 00:08:34.550
Just a holo recording?
Why isn't the governor here in person?

00:08:34.720 --> 00:08:36.180
Risk assessment.

00:08:36.890 --> 00:08:39.350
The protest was larger
than our predictions.

00:08:40.100 --> 00:08:41.100
Please understand.

00:08:46.690 --> 00:08:49.360
I see you're still holding onto
that thing.

00:08:50.440 --> 00:08:51.820
What do you want?

00:08:52.400 --> 00:08:53.780
How's your condition?

00:08:54.200 --> 00:08:57.410
Stage four. I don't have much longer.

00:08:57.570 --> 00:09:00.740
Is that why you sped up acceptance
of the special zone?

00:09:00.910 --> 00:09:02.580
You must understand.

00:09:03.410 --> 00:09:07.580
We may have ended isolation,
but this country hasn't changed.

00:09:08.000 --> 00:09:10.090
Change takes time.

00:09:11.090 --> 00:09:12.840
I don't have time.

00:09:13.420 --> 00:09:16.260
You still have time
to watch over the child.

00:09:23.310 --> 00:09:26.100
Huh? Is it malfunctioning?

00:09:26.310 --> 00:09:28.060
Did something happen?

00:09:28.480 --> 00:09:31.020
It's showing an odd area stress response.

00:09:31.610 --> 00:09:33.860
Deploy everything to its location.

00:10:00.680 --> 00:10:01.550
Inspector!

00:10:02.310 --> 00:10:04.310
Kei, watch the stage.

00:10:04.850 --> 00:10:05.730
Roger.

00:10:06.560 --> 00:10:07.310
Let's move.

00:10:09.310 --> 00:10:10.650
Good grief.

00:10:27.370 --> 00:10:31.330
Crime Coefficient is 153.
Target for enforcement.

00:10:31.750 --> 00:10:33.590
Non-Lethal Paralyzer.

00:10:41.640 --> 00:10:44.140
Audi nos!

00:10:44.260 --> 00:10:45.560
Everyone, get down!

00:10:53.060 --> 00:10:53.730
Kei!

00:11:00.660 --> 00:11:03.700
Don't you think the boy's at his limit?

00:11:04.830 --> 00:11:07.700
Yes, the time may be ripe.

00:11:08.660 --> 00:11:10.710
I'll take that as a "yes."

00:11:11.210 --> 00:11:15.840
If I recall correctly, there was
a friendless congressman once before.

00:11:16.590 --> 00:11:19.720
Toya Saionji, I believe his name was.

00:11:20.720 --> 00:11:22.720
I won't end up like my brother.

00:11:23.090 --> 00:11:25.560
As Sibyl evolves,

00:11:25.720 --> 00:11:31.600
fewer and fewer people can cross
the dangerous bridge of Bifrost.

00:11:32.100 --> 00:11:35.360
Look away,
and you'll end up head over heels.

00:11:39.280 --> 00:11:40.650
Sorry I'm late.

00:11:42.280 --> 00:11:44.070
Invest in rural infrastructure.

00:11:45.700 --> 00:11:47.490
Promote scanner installation.

00:11:48.120 --> 00:11:50.540
Enhance Ministry of Welfare regulation.

00:11:50.870 --> 00:11:57.050
Favoring Public Safety as always,
but gentle judgment, considering.

00:11:57.420 --> 00:12:02.050
So, even our bold Shizuka
is at the end of his rope.

00:12:02.590 --> 00:12:04.180
Dealer's judgment.

00:12:04.970 --> 00:12:10.730
Invest in major news agencies. Guide
public opinion to favor the special zone.

00:12:13.020 --> 00:12:14.440
Judgment confirmed.

00:12:15.100 --> 00:12:20.360
Congressmen must participate in all
judgments until the relation concludes.

00:12:21.490 --> 00:12:25.740
Leaving your seat except at set times
and other obstructive behavior

00:12:26.070 --> 00:12:28.120
will result in enforcement action.

00:12:29.620 --> 00:12:33.040
We're investigating
the suicide bomber's identity and motive.

00:12:33.460 --> 00:12:36.250
We think it involves
the Special Religious Zone.

00:12:36.380 --> 00:12:38.960
Collect evidence
to prevent further crimes.

00:12:39.130 --> 00:12:43.260
Find out everything about
where the bomb came from.

00:12:43.970 --> 00:12:44.800
Yes, ma'am.

00:12:47.180 --> 00:12:50.770
Also, I assume you remember Sasagawa?

00:12:51.220 --> 00:12:53.600
The suspect in the subprime case?

00:12:56.190 --> 00:12:58.770
Didn't Foreign Affairs' SAD arrest him?

00:12:59.190 --> 00:13:00.270
He's dead.

00:13:00.650 --> 00:13:04.490
Apparently the car transporting him
to Dejima was in an accident.

00:13:05.320 --> 00:13:07.870
Was it really an accident?

00:13:08.370 --> 00:13:10.280
Foreign Affairs is investigating.

00:13:11.080 --> 00:13:14.460
They provided data
from his pre-transport questioning.

00:13:15.080 --> 00:13:19.040
Sasagawa mentioned Koichi Azusawa by name.

00:13:19.420 --> 00:13:22.880
The man our predecessors
were pursuing, right?

00:13:24.510 --> 00:13:29.180
I authorize you to view
classified materials up to level two.

00:13:29.550 --> 00:13:32.060
Consider links to the terrorist bombing,

00:13:33.430 --> 00:13:35.890
and study up on the foxes.

00:13:38.310 --> 00:13:41.900
The suicide bomber was an immigrant
named Marcel Cotard.

00:13:42.610 --> 00:13:48.660
We've learned he was a factory worker in
New Town who went missing six months ago.

00:13:48.820 --> 00:13:54.160
How did he get a bomb
through the hazardous material sensors?

00:13:54.290 --> 00:13:56.040
It was embedded in his body.

00:13:56.460 --> 00:13:59.330
In his stomach? That's crazy.

00:13:59.500 --> 00:14:02.670
Remember how the area stress
was going up and down?

00:14:03.420 --> 00:14:06.170
It seems he was drugged
into a hypnotic state.

00:14:06.510 --> 00:14:10.300
Meaning we can speculate that
someone else masterminded the attack.

00:14:10.640 --> 00:14:13.560
Aiming to massacre
special zone supporters?

00:14:14.310 --> 00:14:15.180
Seems that way.

00:14:16.060 --> 00:14:19.690
All but one supporter in the venue died.

00:14:20.060 --> 00:14:22.860
Its opponents, in contrast, all survived.

00:14:23.480 --> 00:14:24.730
Theresa Shinogi.

00:14:25.150 --> 00:14:29.860
Former refugee advocate in Dejima and
leader of the anti-special-zone faction.

00:14:30.370 --> 00:14:32.660
Next, Joseph Auma.

00:14:33.280 --> 00:14:35.540
Leader of the New Town factory workers.

00:14:36.250 --> 00:14:37.870
Torri Aschenbach.

00:14:38.410 --> 00:14:42.590
Agent for the founder of the authorized
religious group Heaven's Leap.

00:14:43.130 --> 00:14:44.090
Not the founder?

00:14:44.500 --> 00:14:48.720
The founder was the first
Sibyl-authorized religious leader

00:14:48.970 --> 00:14:51.680
and hasn't appeared
in public in six months.

00:14:51.930 --> 00:14:55.390
Smells fishy.
Could they be more suspicious?

00:14:56.180 --> 00:15:02.110
By the way, the suicide bomber Marcel
was a follower of Heaven's Leap.

00:15:03.060 --> 00:15:06.030
That settles it. Let's go enforce them.

00:15:06.320 --> 00:15:08.400
There is one more suspect.

00:15:09.110 --> 00:15:11.200
Kurisu Kyoji O'Brien.

00:15:11.610 --> 00:15:13.910
An observer for the Immigration Bureau.

00:15:14.200 --> 00:15:17.450
His Hue has deteriorated
over the past several months.

00:15:17.790 --> 00:15:20.670
It exceeded permissible values
following the bombing.

00:15:20.870 --> 00:15:24.000
If the theory holds, he was involved.

00:15:24.380 --> 00:15:29.380
But he checked himself into
a psychological care facility last night.

00:15:29.590 --> 00:15:33.010
And he's the organizer of the PR event.

00:15:33.300 --> 00:15:36.100
He should have no motive
to cause terrorism.

00:15:36.310 --> 00:15:39.100
They all seem suspicious.

00:15:39.480 --> 00:15:45.480
Heaven's Leap has the Bureau of Culture's
backing. They're trouble.

00:15:46.020 --> 00:15:48.230
You know about them, Shindo?

00:15:48.690 --> 00:15:51.360
Just a little, through my dad's work.

00:15:51.650 --> 00:15:55.030
I thought Sibyl was a product of science.

00:15:55.370 --> 00:15:57.950
Why would it authorize religion?

00:15:58.160 --> 00:16:03.210
But you believe in crystals
and Feng Shui and stuff, right?

00:16:03.500 --> 00:16:05.460
That's statistics.

00:16:05.630 --> 00:16:09.920
There's no God anyway,
so we may as well get rid of religion.

00:16:10.130 --> 00:16:11.590
I wouldn't be so sure.

00:16:12.590 --> 00:16:16.600
It's not a question of
whether or not there is a God.

00:16:17.390 --> 00:16:21.980
Just being conscious of Heaven
and Hell changes how people act.

00:16:22.690 --> 00:16:27.230
Religion does have a violent history,
and Sibyl is wary of that.

00:16:27.650 --> 00:16:30.990
However, faith isn't that simple.

00:16:32.150 --> 00:16:35.110
Do you believe in something, Inspector?

00:16:35.240 --> 00:16:38.740
No, but most prejudice
stems from ignorance.

00:16:38.870 --> 00:16:39.660
Ignorance?

00:16:39.990 --> 00:16:41.620
Oh, forget I said that.

00:16:41.750 --> 00:16:44.170
You can't take it back once you say it.

00:16:44.330 --> 00:16:45.670
That's enough.

00:16:46.580 --> 00:16:50.250
Start by checking everyone involved
for links to bombs.

00:16:50.380 --> 00:16:53.800
A bomb hunt? Give me a break.

00:16:53.930 --> 00:16:57.470
Come on, let's get going on
another fun day on the job!

00:17:03.100 --> 00:17:04.020
Shion.

00:17:04.520 --> 00:17:05.770
I need a favor.

00:17:06.230 --> 00:17:08.360
What, again?

00:17:08.520 --> 00:17:14.530
We're up against dangerous people. I want
to bring in that legendary lady detective.

00:17:14.700 --> 00:17:17.870
On this case?
Can you guarantee her safety?

00:17:18.030 --> 00:17:18.870
I will.

00:17:22.750 --> 00:17:25.210
Kurisu O'Brien is in care. He can wait.

00:17:25.920 --> 00:17:29.420
Arata, make sure you don't
perform any Mental Traces.

00:17:29.920 --> 00:17:32.510
Yeah, yeah, I know.

00:17:43.060 --> 00:17:47.400
I'm Torri Aschenbach. I represent
the founder of Heaven's Leap.

00:17:47.810 --> 00:17:53.780
Forgive my presumption, but I welcome you
as a fellow protector of Psycho-Passes.

00:17:54.610 --> 00:17:56.320
Thank you for your cooperation.

00:17:56.490 --> 00:17:57.910
Now, go ahead.

00:17:58.910 --> 00:18:02.660
Point your Dominator at me.
It's your duty, is it not?

00:18:07.040 --> 00:18:11.170
Crime Coefficient is 19.
Not a target for enforcement action.

00:18:11.790 --> 00:18:13.460
What a clear Hue.

00:18:13.630 --> 00:18:15.300
I'd expect no less.

00:18:18.260 --> 00:18:21.800
Would the latent criminals
please wait here?

00:18:22.350 --> 00:18:24.930
We request that you not enter the church.

00:18:25.100 --> 00:18:26.730
What was that?

00:18:26.850 --> 00:18:30.060
I want to avoid trouble.
Remain on standby.

00:18:31.560 --> 00:18:32.610
Fine.

00:18:38.900 --> 00:18:41.950
Warning. Link not fully established.

00:18:42.370 --> 00:18:44.620
Check your connection environment.

00:18:44.950 --> 00:18:46.290
You're blocking signals?

00:18:46.410 --> 00:18:48.160
Throughout the whole church.

00:18:48.500 --> 00:18:53.250
It's so that we may preserve our Hues
and face Sibyl with pure hearts.

00:18:53.840 --> 00:18:55.840
Almost like a quarantine facility.

00:18:56.340 --> 00:18:59.260
We aim to be prepared for anything.

00:19:05.180 --> 00:19:06.140
You know him?

00:19:06.600 --> 00:19:10.730
This was once a medical facility.
It has ties to the athletics world.

00:19:10.980 --> 00:19:14.730
If Mr. Yakushiji
had won the gubernatorial election,

00:19:14.860 --> 00:19:17.490
this tragedy would never have occurred.

00:19:18.360 --> 00:19:19.740
What a pity.

00:19:22.320 --> 00:19:26.370
Are you aware that the suicide bomber
was one of your followers?

00:19:26.790 --> 00:19:28.580
Are you certain?

00:19:29.080 --> 00:19:29.870
Positive.

00:19:30.710 --> 00:19:33.830
Why did you leave the stage
before the blast?

00:19:34.040 --> 00:19:35.590
As an act of protest.

00:19:35.800 --> 00:19:39.130
I'd hate to be a suspect
simply because I escaped harm.

00:19:39.720 --> 00:19:41.340
Why oppose the special zone?

00:19:41.510 --> 00:19:45.510
Limiting where people can live
based on religion is unconscionable.

00:19:45.720 --> 00:19:50.730
Especially as it is not an oracle from
Sibyl, but the governor playing politics.

00:19:51.350 --> 00:19:53.350
Is that what your founder teaches?

00:19:53.730 --> 00:19:57.610
Yes. It is a sacred teaching
to guide all people.

00:19:58.400 --> 00:20:00.610
I would like to meet Founder Nisei.

00:20:00.950 --> 00:20:05.240
Unfortunately, he entered a special state
of prayer six months ago.

00:20:05.410 --> 00:20:07.620
No one knows when it will end.

00:20:08.580 --> 00:20:11.250
I can exercise my authority to compel him.

00:20:12.250 --> 00:20:13.750
That won't work.

00:20:14.880 --> 00:20:16.040
Why not?

00:20:16.460 --> 00:20:20.760
Do you know how many believers
we have in the Ministry of Welfare?

00:20:23.260 --> 00:20:29.310
In fact, we may soon wield Dominators
on equal footing with Public Safety.

00:20:29.680 --> 00:20:31.770
I doubt Sibyl would authorize it.

00:20:32.640 --> 00:20:34.060
You'll understand soon.

00:20:34.560 --> 00:20:38.150
We merely await the oracle.

00:20:55.080 --> 00:20:57.960
I'm sorry for the sudden request,
Ms. Kunizuka.

00:20:58.750 --> 00:21:02.380
Don't worry about it.
I'll help in any way I can.

00:21:03.420 --> 00:21:05.630
I won't let it be like the Giga Arena.

00:21:05.760 --> 00:21:08.550
I don't mind. I'm used to it.

00:21:08.970 --> 00:21:10.890
That's our legendary lady detective!

00:21:11.350 --> 00:21:12.770
Stop calling me that.

00:21:18.940 --> 00:21:22.610
Abandon selfish desire.
Let us attain Nirvana together.

00:21:23.990 --> 00:21:27.070
Thank you for complying, Venerable Auma.

00:21:27.410 --> 00:21:30.410
I care not.
It was a favor for you, after all.

00:21:32.410 --> 00:21:34.410
I'm Inspector Arata Shindo.

00:21:34.790 --> 00:21:37.580
Did you plan the incident the other day?

00:21:37.750 --> 00:21:38.670
Hey!

00:21:39.080 --> 00:21:42.130
Point your ray gun at me
if you want to know.

00:21:42.630 --> 00:21:45.260
I think I'll take you up on that offer.

00:21:47.260 --> 00:21:51.640
Crime Coefficient is 26.
Not a target for enforcement action.

00:21:52.140 --> 00:21:55.270
That's too clear for an old ex-guerrilla.

00:21:55.390 --> 00:21:56.850
Watch your mouth.

00:21:57.230 --> 00:21:58.650
Oh, I'm so scared.

00:21:59.230 --> 00:22:03.110
I attained enlightenment
atop a mountain of corpses.

00:22:08.280 --> 00:22:09.450
Is this real?

00:22:09.620 --> 00:22:12.540
Don't be afraid.
The explosives have been removed.

00:22:13.080 --> 00:22:18.460
Joseph Auma survived
an explosive misfire and found Buddhism.

00:22:19.170 --> 00:22:20.790
What else would you ask?

00:22:21.590 --> 00:22:24.550
Do you believe the suicide bomber
acted alone?

00:22:25.010 --> 00:22:27.630
No. He was merely controlled.

00:22:28.260 --> 00:22:30.470
Who do you think controlled him?

00:22:30.640 --> 00:22:34.640
Probably an amateur. Had it been me,
there would be no survivors.

00:22:34.770 --> 00:22:37.180
Any ideas about the explosives they used?

00:22:37.690 --> 00:22:40.480
We have laid down all our weapons.

00:22:40.810 --> 00:22:44.190
It was the price for my brethren
to dwell in this land.

00:22:44.650 --> 00:22:49.490
This is your turf, isn't it? You say
you don't know where the bomb came from?

00:22:49.700 --> 00:22:50.700
Cut it out.

00:22:51.320 --> 00:22:52.910
Practice asceticism.

00:22:53.030 --> 00:22:57.830
When you extinguish your flame of rage,
you too may be as she is.

00:23:00.210 --> 00:23:04.250
Follow the right path,
and you will meet the one you wait for.

00:23:05.800 --> 00:23:08.590
A lecture from an ex-guerrilla boss?
Seriously?

00:23:08.840 --> 00:23:09.720
Now, now.

00:23:10.220 --> 00:23:11.930
What's the "right path"?

00:23:12.050 --> 00:23:15.180
The CRP, Council of the Right Path.

00:23:15.640 --> 00:23:19.980
A refugee protection group in Dejima.
They manage the infrastructure here.

00:23:20.390 --> 00:23:21.020
Look.

00:23:24.020 --> 00:23:26.400
Sister Theresa Shinogi represents them.

00:23:27.070 --> 00:23:29.530
She's a religious leader and founder.

00:23:30.150 --> 00:23:32.030
Our next target.

00:23:32.450 --> 00:23:33.620
Can you contact her?

00:23:33.910 --> 00:23:34.910
Yes, of course.

00:23:35.780 --> 00:23:36.540
What?

00:23:36.830 --> 00:23:38.750
Yes, we'll be right there.

00:23:39.540 --> 00:23:40.460
What's going on?

00:23:40.790 --> 00:23:42.790
Trouble over the terrorist attack.

00:23:43.330 --> 00:23:45.130
The Sister is going to mediate.

00:23:48.170 --> 00:23:51.760
May the Lord's blessings
and grace be with you.

00:23:52.090 --> 00:23:57.510
Everyone should be able to find happiness,
no matter their circumstances.

00:23:57.640 --> 00:23:58.720
We know.

00:24:03.600 --> 00:24:05.360
Oh my, Ms. Kunizuka.

00:24:05.480 --> 00:24:08.280
I'm sorry you had to see that.

00:24:08.610 --> 00:24:12.070
I'm impressed you were able
to mediate alone.

00:24:12.240 --> 00:24:13.990
All she did was pay them off.

00:24:14.110 --> 00:24:15.570
That's enough out of you.

00:24:16.240 --> 00:24:19.080
Money is their god.

00:24:19.750 --> 00:24:21.620
I'm glad things worked out.

00:24:22.750 --> 00:24:25.920
Would you give me a moment,
Inspector Arata Shindo?

00:24:26.090 --> 00:24:27.800
We'll speak afterward.

00:24:33.130 --> 00:24:34.800
He looks like the bomber.

00:24:35.640 --> 00:24:40.310
This is Ishak,
the bomber Marcel's twin brother.

00:24:40.640 --> 00:24:42.430
We shouldn't let him go, then.

00:24:42.770 --> 00:24:47.900
He doesn't know anything.
Marcel vanished six months ago.

00:24:48.150 --> 00:24:50.320
Please let us interview him.

00:24:50.980 --> 00:24:53.490
Would you tell us about your brother?

00:24:53.820 --> 00:24:58.450
Marcel's Hue was getting bad,
so he joined Heaven's Leap.

00:24:59.030 --> 00:25:01.080
Said it beat being institutionalized.

00:25:01.580 --> 00:25:03.620
Did he contact you after vanishing?

00:25:04.250 --> 00:25:05.040
No.

00:25:06.170 --> 00:25:08.290
I was honestly relieved he was gone.

00:25:09.090 --> 00:25:11.340
He used to hit me to blow off steam.

00:25:11.960 --> 00:25:14.840
I believe you can tell
he's telling the truth?

00:25:15.090 --> 00:25:16.930
Yes, it appears he is.

00:25:21.680 --> 00:25:25.390
Now, before we begin,
please point your guns at me.

00:25:25.560 --> 00:25:26.770
You heard the lady.

00:25:26.900 --> 00:25:27.980
Fine.

00:25:30.150 --> 00:25:34.650
Crime Coefficient is 22.
Not a target for enforcement action.

00:25:35.700 --> 00:25:36.610
Clear.

00:25:37.030 --> 00:25:39.660
That's quite clear,
considering that bombing.

00:25:40.370 --> 00:25:42.660
That is the fruit of my faith.

00:25:43.370 --> 00:25:45.870
You think blowing people up is faith, too?

00:25:47.040 --> 00:25:52.090
On the contrary, that's the path
of nihilism that has lost faith.

00:25:52.210 --> 00:25:57.010
Faith ought to be a safety valve
to stop extremist ideas from taking root.

00:25:57.180 --> 00:25:59.970
In that way,
the special zone makes sense.

00:26:00.100 --> 00:26:01.640
So why do you oppose it?

00:26:02.180 --> 00:26:06.140
A good ideology is meaningless
if it's poor in practice.

00:26:06.600 --> 00:26:11.020
Oh, and speaking of practice,
how is Kurisu O'Brien's condition?

00:26:11.150 --> 00:26:13.190
He's undergoing emergency care.

00:26:13.320 --> 00:26:15.610
Then I suppose I can rest easy for now.

00:26:16.360 --> 00:26:18.700
Mr. O'Brien is pro-special-zone, right?

00:26:18.990 --> 00:26:22.790
We're estranged now,
but we're old comrades from Dejima.

00:26:22.990 --> 00:26:26.040
He was a founding member of the CRP.

00:26:26.160 --> 00:26:27.920
You protected refugees there?

00:26:30.460 --> 00:26:33.710
Yes. That's why we protested
against isolationism.

00:26:33.920 --> 00:26:38.220
I also knew Nisei,
the founder of Heaven's Leap, at the time,

00:26:38.340 --> 00:26:42.220
but we lost contact when
his current representative took over.

00:26:42.850 --> 00:26:44.640
You're very well connected.

00:26:44.930 --> 00:26:48.100
Not as well connected as your father.

00:26:48.560 --> 00:26:50.060
You knew my dad?

00:26:50.900 --> 00:26:53.940
He helped us to establish the CRP.

00:26:54.820 --> 00:26:59.780
You were young at the time,
and he was always worried about you.

00:27:00.700 --> 00:27:01.950
I see.

00:27:02.370 --> 00:27:07.500
Parents always worry about what path
their children will choose.

00:27:07.790 --> 00:27:13.250
Take care that seeing things that aren't
there doesn't lead you down a dark path.

00:27:14.880 --> 00:27:15.550
I will.

00:27:18.050 --> 00:27:20.590
Now, I must prepare for mass.

00:27:21.430 --> 00:27:23.350
Would you care to join us?

00:27:23.970 --> 00:27:26.970
We'd love to, but we have work to do.

00:27:36.820 --> 00:27:39.990
Time may have stopped for this boy,

00:27:40.490 --> 00:27:43.410
but that doesn't mean
you should follow suit.

00:27:47.450 --> 00:27:51.370
What did your father do in Dejima,
Inspector Shindo?

00:27:51.920 --> 00:27:53.830
Something about exporting Sibyl.

00:27:54.000 --> 00:27:57.170
Because of that,
I lived in Dejima for a while myself.

00:27:58.010 --> 00:27:59.800
Wasn't that in my file?

00:28:00.050 --> 00:28:01.880
No, we didn't look that...

00:28:10.310 --> 00:28:11.940
Honestly, dear.

00:28:12.270 --> 00:28:16.480
You should have told me you were hurt,
even if it wasn't serious.

00:28:16.650 --> 00:28:19.280
Wow, he didn't tell you?

00:28:19.440 --> 00:28:21.990
Maybe Kei's keeping other secrets
from you.

00:28:22.150 --> 00:28:23.450
Of course I'm not.

00:28:24.870 --> 00:28:29.160
Well, it really was minor,
and he got it protecting his comrades,

00:28:29.450 --> 00:28:32.460
so he didn't want to show it off.
Right, Kei?

00:28:33.040 --> 00:28:33.870
Yeah.

00:28:36.670 --> 00:28:40.460
More importantly, I hear your operation
is coming up. Congratulations!

00:28:41.970 --> 00:28:43.720
Thank you, Arata.

00:28:44.800 --> 00:28:49.220
But is it really all right? There are
many people worse off than I am.

00:28:49.560 --> 00:28:53.480
Don't think that way.
There's no reason you should suffer.

00:28:54.060 --> 00:28:55.980
I'm sure your mom feels the same.

00:28:56.190 --> 00:28:57.310
That's right.

00:28:57.770 --> 00:29:02.190
She's up in heaven,
wishing for you to be happier.

00:29:02.740 --> 00:29:03.740
Thank you.

00:29:06.200 --> 00:29:11.750
So, is what's happening now
related to our case?

00:29:12.200 --> 00:29:13.870
It's too soon to say.

00:29:14.120 --> 00:29:17.630
Whether it is or not, we'll solve it.

00:29:19.880 --> 00:29:22.340
Don't forget our promise.

00:29:22.800 --> 00:29:26.760
Whatever truth we uncover,
we'll trust each other.

00:29:29.890 --> 00:29:30.680
Yeah.

00:29:34.850 --> 00:29:38.690
Mai almost never asks
about cases like that.

00:29:39.110 --> 00:29:44.030
It's the bombing. She's worried there'll
be conflict like in our motherland.

00:29:45.150 --> 00:29:48.950
And it's not as though this country
has completely accepted us.

00:29:50.240 --> 00:29:55.040
This country is progressing,
little by little. So is our case.

00:29:56.870 --> 00:30:00.790
We can view classified data now,
although only up to level two.

00:30:01.670 --> 00:30:07.220
There wasn't much on Koichi Azusawa, but
something about the foxes caught my eye.

00:30:07.930 --> 00:30:10.550
You mean that someone is scouting them?

00:30:11.220 --> 00:30:12.180
Exactly.

00:30:12.310 --> 00:30:17.310
Sasagawa and Enomiya were both scouted
and under the control of an organization.

00:30:17.940 --> 00:30:21.770
The foxes are growing in number,
and they're organized.

00:30:23.110 --> 00:30:25.690
My dad had the same card.

00:30:28.280 --> 00:30:31.410
Don't leap to conclusions.
Atsushi was a good person.

00:30:31.780 --> 00:30:34.240
Akira was a good brother, too.

00:30:34.620 --> 00:30:38.920
There must be a reason.
We'll uncover the truth over time.

00:30:39.290 --> 00:30:43.250
Listen, maybe if I Mental Trace
the suicide bomber, we'll...

00:30:45.710 --> 00:30:48.090
No Mental Traces. Period.

00:30:48.510 --> 00:30:50.010
I know, I know.

00:30:50.140 --> 00:30:51.350
I hope so.

00:30:51.800 --> 00:30:52.600
Go on.

00:30:53.970 --> 00:30:56.850
We're here. Rest and take it easy today.

00:30:57.140 --> 00:30:58.940
Fine.

00:31:15.990 --> 00:31:20.250
You were young at the time,
and he was always worried about you.

00:31:25.750 --> 00:31:26.630
Dad.

00:31:27.670 --> 00:31:30.380
What?! This case is none of your business!

00:31:30.880 --> 00:31:33.220
It involves anti-isolation policy.

00:31:33.550 --> 00:31:36.890
When you make your move, so will we.

00:31:37.350 --> 00:31:39.310
Then give us your intel!

00:31:39.850 --> 00:31:42.350
I'm supplying you with as much as I can.

00:31:42.600 --> 00:31:46.400
Remember to keep our activities in mind.

00:31:47.230 --> 00:31:49.490
I'll do what I can.

00:32:03.000 --> 00:32:05.290
Good morning, Venerable Auma.

00:32:05.790 --> 00:32:08.840
Did you take the right path, Shindo?

00:32:10.300 --> 00:32:11.590
I took a few steps.

00:32:12.930 --> 00:32:14.850
You say you've found evidence?

00:32:15.300 --> 00:32:19.890
Yes. One of the church's medical drones
was stolen a short time ago.

00:32:20.060 --> 00:32:22.770
Sister Shinogi consulted me about it.

00:32:23.020 --> 00:32:25.560
One of my followers found the drone,

00:32:25.770 --> 00:32:29.530
but it seems it may be related
to the bombing.

00:32:30.490 --> 00:32:31.860
Thank you for reporting it.

00:32:32.570 --> 00:32:34.200
No need to thank me.

00:32:34.360 --> 00:32:40.000
Please stop those sad fools
who seek to meet their end in fire.

00:32:48.340 --> 00:32:51.970
The timing of his report is too perfect.

00:32:52.420 --> 00:32:55.220
Yeah, but it doesn't seem malicious.

00:32:55.720 --> 00:32:57.430
What about Sister Shinogi?

00:32:57.800 --> 00:33:00.720
She hasn't come to the church
since she left yesterday.

00:33:01.270 --> 00:33:02.730
I'll ask our analyst.

00:33:03.440 --> 00:33:05.940
Tell me when you get results on the drone.

00:33:06.440 --> 00:33:08.980
We'll join you once we interview O'Brien.

00:33:16.070 --> 00:33:17.160
Public Safety.

00:33:17.700 --> 00:33:22.580
I'm here to see Kurisu Kyoji O'Brien
in room 1703.

00:33:23.000 --> 00:33:25.500
Let me check. Please wait a moment.

00:33:26.000 --> 00:33:27.670
He's actually here?

00:33:27.960 --> 00:33:31.670
They say pharmaceutical companies
run experiments here.

00:33:31.880 --> 00:33:32.840
Experiments?

00:33:34.380 --> 00:33:36.220
They're only rumors.

00:33:36.970 --> 00:33:40.510
My apologies. Mr. O'Brien
is currently seeing a visitor.

00:33:41.060 --> 00:33:42.520
Please wait.

00:33:43.180 --> 00:33:44.140
What do we do?

00:33:44.770 --> 00:33:46.480
Use our authority to enter.

00:33:46.650 --> 00:33:48.020
That's the spirit!

00:33:57.280 --> 00:34:01.280
No legal sales data.
Must be a black market drone.

00:34:01.870 --> 00:34:03.700
They don't have enough doctors.

00:34:04.160 --> 00:34:06.710
It's illegal, but mostly tolerated.

00:34:07.250 --> 00:34:09.170
Where'd it originally come from?

00:34:09.790 --> 00:34:11.040
Probably Dejima.

00:34:11.750 --> 00:34:13.460
There are some nasty rumors

00:34:13.880 --> 00:34:19.300
that Sister Shinogi seizes property
in exchange for immigration assistance.

00:34:20.010 --> 00:34:24.520
Now you mention it, Auma mentioned
having to give up weapons.

00:34:24.770 --> 00:34:27.980
I've finished restoring
the recording data, Inspector.

00:34:29.900 --> 00:34:31.310
It's the real deal.

00:34:31.730 --> 00:34:36.490
It implanted bombs in human bodies
using an organ transplant program.

00:34:36.820 --> 00:34:39.700
The surgery was performed five times.

00:34:40.570 --> 00:34:43.990
Meaning there are four more out there.

00:34:53.500 --> 00:34:55.300
Kisaragi, evacuate the patients!

00:34:55.460 --> 00:34:58.010
Todoroki, with me! We'll secure O'Brien!

00:35:02.890 --> 00:35:04.350
This is O'Brien's room.

00:35:04.810 --> 00:35:05.850
Find him!

00:35:17.190 --> 00:35:18.900
Looks like we found him.

00:35:19.400 --> 00:35:21.660
Not in the way we wanted him, though.

00:35:25.950 --> 00:35:29.460
Collating data.
This is Kurisu Kyoji O'Brien.

00:35:31.080 --> 00:35:33.460
This second bombing
was in the city center.

00:35:33.920 --> 00:35:36.090
You were there and couldn't stop it?

00:35:37.380 --> 00:35:38.420
My apologies.

00:35:38.590 --> 00:35:41.510
The bomber was another member
of Heaven's Leap.

00:35:42.090 --> 00:35:44.890
The sect denies entrance
for Hue preservation.

00:35:46.060 --> 00:35:49.230
I'll negotiate with them.
What about the bombs?

00:35:49.430 --> 00:35:53.900
Evidence suggests there are three more.
We're searching for them now.

00:35:54.520 --> 00:35:55.570
Any suspects?

00:35:55.980 --> 00:35:58.400
The anti-special-zone faction.

00:35:58.570 --> 00:36:01.950
But the Hues of all its representatives
were clear.

00:36:02.110 --> 00:36:03.530
No leads at all?

00:36:03.660 --> 00:36:06.450
Anything special about the victim?

00:36:06.950 --> 00:36:10.580
The victim, Kurisu Kyoji O'Brien,
had terminal cancer.

00:36:11.660 --> 00:36:14.460
They murdered a man at death's door?

00:36:15.130 --> 00:36:16.840
Unless they didn't know.

00:36:17.210 --> 00:36:20.050
Oh, and regarding Sister Shinogi,

00:36:20.170 --> 00:36:24.050
records show she visited
O'Brien's hospital room last night.

00:36:24.220 --> 00:36:26.100
We don't know where she is now.

00:36:27.310 --> 00:36:32.230
And the medical drone used for the bomb
transplants was purchased in her name?

00:36:32.440 --> 00:36:35.110
Yes, but I don't think she is...

00:36:35.440 --> 00:36:38.860
It's enough for a household search!
Now go solve this case!

00:36:41.570 --> 00:36:46.240
Usage of illegal drugs on immigrants
was uncovered at the bombed facility.

00:36:46.700 --> 00:36:48.120
It's all over the news.

00:36:48.620 --> 00:36:51.000
Hence the strict information control?

00:36:51.410 --> 00:36:56.130
Politicians supporting Heaven's Leap
have also lodged complaints.

00:36:56.580 --> 00:36:58.800
No wonder the chief was pissed off.

00:36:59.090 --> 00:37:00.550
They beat us twice.

00:37:01.510 --> 00:37:03.300
We'll stop them the third time.

00:37:16.860 --> 00:37:17.650
Kaboom!

00:37:18.980 --> 00:37:20.480
Give it a rest, idiot!

00:37:29.780 --> 00:37:32.660
The caregiver drone's
life-support program is running.

00:37:33.410 --> 00:37:35.120
Who was it treating?

00:37:36.830 --> 00:37:37.710
Life-support?

00:37:44.880 --> 00:37:47.720
No luck. Nothing's coming up.

00:37:49.930 --> 00:37:52.140
Same here, damn it.

00:37:52.350 --> 00:37:55.310
We turned the place upside down
and came up empty?

00:37:59.770 --> 00:38:01.650
I wouldn't say so.

00:38:07.160 --> 00:38:10.240
A report on a terrorist attack in Dejima.

00:38:10.700 --> 00:38:15.580
Lists of smuggling groups.
Data on crimes concerning immigrants.

00:38:16.210 --> 00:38:18.420
She really could be behind it.

00:38:18.750 --> 00:38:21.670
The nun's gotta be our perp.

00:38:21.880 --> 00:38:24.170
Let's enforce her and get it over with.

00:38:24.340 --> 00:38:27.300
Except she's gone into hiding.

00:38:28.720 --> 00:38:33.350
There were also documents on the New Town
warehouse district's management.

00:38:34.020 --> 00:38:38.600
Many of the warehouses are jointly owned
by Mr. O'Brien and Sister Shinogi.

00:38:38.980 --> 00:38:42.190
Seems the car rental's
administrative server

00:38:42.570 --> 00:38:48.240
showed Auma moving something
from the factory to those warehouses.

00:38:48.860 --> 00:38:52.620
So, they were all
in a smuggling racket together?

00:38:52.910 --> 00:38:59.040
If so, the anti-special-zone faction
feared its creation would expose them,

00:38:59.250 --> 00:39:03.130
and murdered its supporters.
We have a motive.

00:39:04.380 --> 00:39:08.170
But what about Heaven's Leap?
I doubt they're uninvolved.

00:39:08.420 --> 00:39:12.600
Well, I found something strange
about their founder's representative.

00:39:13.350 --> 00:39:16.810
He started a company at 13
and became its CEO.

00:39:17.100 --> 00:39:21.650
He went on to own 18 different businesses
before becoming a religious leader.

00:39:21.770 --> 00:39:22.900
What's up with that?

00:39:23.360 --> 00:39:25.940
Is that kind of career change
even possible?

00:39:26.230 --> 00:39:28.360
Well, it's not illegal, at least.

00:39:29.950 --> 00:39:33.070
Sounds just like Koichi Azusawa.

00:39:39.460 --> 00:39:41.500
So, about Heaven's Leap.

00:39:42.290 --> 00:39:45.670
They regularly make large deliveries
out of the country,

00:39:45.960 --> 00:39:50.510
through state guests received
by Mr. O'Brien.

00:39:55.140 --> 00:39:57.270
Smuggling via state guests?

00:39:57.390 --> 00:40:00.520
That damn cult is a smuggling ring?!

00:40:01.140 --> 00:40:03.860
If the freight in the warehouses
is involved,

00:40:04.270 --> 00:40:06.900
Heaven's Leap
could be sheltering the sister.

00:40:07.610 --> 00:40:13.160
We need to find out
what they're shipping overseas.

00:40:13.320 --> 00:40:16.830
Then we have two targets:
The warehouses and Heaven's Leap.

00:40:17.450 --> 00:40:18.540
I'll help.

00:40:18.910 --> 00:40:22.460
Wait a minute.
There are three bombs left, remember?

00:40:22.580 --> 00:40:25.290
So? I can't back out now.

00:40:26.420 --> 00:40:28.300
I'll keep her out of danger.

00:40:29.090 --> 00:40:34.180
That said, we don't have the chief's
approval to investigate Heaven's Leap yet.

00:40:34.340 --> 00:40:35.260
About that.

00:40:36.350 --> 00:40:41.060
Heaven's Leap had a photo on display
of this man on the state guest.

00:40:44.350 --> 00:40:46.310
The acting leader's relative...

00:40:46.980 --> 00:40:48.190
An uncle, apparently.

00:41:00.040 --> 00:41:01.950
Mr. Viktor Zaharias, I presume?

00:41:02.540 --> 00:41:05.880
Cooperate with us
or face compulsory questioning.

00:41:06.960 --> 00:41:09.300
What? What do you want me to do?

00:41:15.760 --> 00:41:19.180
You arrested a state guest
for a covert investigation?!

00:41:19.510 --> 00:41:22.230
Yes, ma'am.
You did say "any means necessary."

00:41:22.390 --> 00:41:24.020
"Go solve this case!"

00:41:26.730 --> 00:41:30.530
Enforcer Hinakawa
is producing an infiltration holo.

00:41:30.900 --> 00:41:34.740
We'll begin as soon
as we have your approval, ma'am.

00:41:38.160 --> 00:41:40.280
What goods are he going to receive?

00:41:40.910 --> 00:41:42.910
We'll find out once we infiltrate.

00:41:44.250 --> 00:41:48.380
If you screw up,
you'll hit the ground so hard...

00:41:51.090 --> 00:41:51.960
Yes, ma'am!

00:41:52.630 --> 00:41:54.550
Compatibility and Aptitude Examination

00:41:55.010 --> 00:41:58.050
Sibyl's compatibility examination
results came back.

00:41:58.720 --> 00:42:02.810
Our undercover investigators
will be Kei and Mao.

00:42:03.140 --> 00:42:06.440
But I was planning to do it.

00:42:08.860 --> 00:42:12.940
You're a "D" with everyone.
What are you, a social misfit?

00:42:14.440 --> 00:42:18.320
Is that how you talk
to a fellow inspector?

00:42:20.160 --> 00:42:21.830
It's a pleasure, Kisaragi.

00:42:22.410 --> 00:42:23.080
Yes, sir.

00:42:27.670 --> 00:42:28.330
What?

00:42:30.540 --> 00:42:32.000
Are you screwing with me?

00:42:32.130 --> 00:42:33.050
What do you mean?

00:42:33.170 --> 00:42:35.590
National Center for Medical Research

00:42:37.970 --> 00:42:41.350
I'm sorry,
I won't be able to accompany you.

00:42:41.680 --> 00:42:44.970
I'm fine.
You're the one who should be careful, Kei.

00:42:46.060 --> 00:42:47.190
Don't worry.

00:42:47.690 --> 00:42:50.860
Your operation will go great, Mai.

00:42:52.150 --> 00:42:54.480
Thanks, Arata.

00:43:00.240 --> 00:43:02.120
Operating

00:43:03.280 --> 00:43:08.120
I can't believe I'm praying to God.
I thought I'd lost faith a long time ago.

00:43:08.750 --> 00:43:13.380
Maybe you got to see her off
before infiltrating because you prayed?

00:43:14.630 --> 00:43:15.840
Maybe.

00:43:24.430 --> 00:43:27.810
The holos can only operate continuously
for up to four hours.

00:43:28.180 --> 00:43:30.140
Remember to keep them charged.

00:43:32.020 --> 00:43:34.900
Communication is impossible
inside the facility.

00:43:35.530 --> 00:43:38.740
Find a way to get outside
when you want to contact us.

00:43:38.950 --> 00:43:40.660
Yes, understood.

00:43:41.200 --> 00:43:42.110
Kisaragi.

00:43:42.490 --> 00:43:43.160
What?

00:43:43.620 --> 00:43:47.330
If things get hairy,
I'll come to the rescue. Don't worry.

00:43:51.830 --> 00:43:53.210
Do you not trust me?

00:43:53.380 --> 00:43:55.460
It's time. Let's go.

00:43:56.050 --> 00:43:56.670
Yes, sir.

00:44:05.100 --> 00:44:07.010
Don't worry about Mai.

00:44:07.430 --> 00:44:10.180
I'll keep an eye on her while you're gone.

00:44:10.730 --> 00:44:14.360
We'll find the sister
and prevent the next terrorist attack.

00:44:29.620 --> 00:44:32.540
Stupid perfection in your own castle

00:44:34.880 --> 00:44:38.380
How smart. You cause me to yawn

00:44:39.840 --> 00:44:45.300
Look,
The key to the door is in your hand

00:44:45.470 --> 00:44:50.560
Don't you let anyone take control

00:44:50.730 --> 00:44:55.860
What do you want?

00:44:56.020 --> 00:45:01.240
Go get it. Play by your own rule

00:45:01.360 --> 00:45:07.070
The winner always controls the game

00:45:07.240 --> 00:45:12.080
You stand in your belief

00:45:15.460 --> 00:45:19.960
There's no promising future

00:45:20.420 --> 00:45:25.590
Always helpless
Crying for the moon

00:45:25.720 --> 00:45:30.770
Finger trembles in fear
With the weight of the trigger

00:45:31.020 --> 00:45:33.940
There's a way for us

00:45:34.140 --> 00:45:38.110
Show them how we fight

00:45:38.310 --> 00:45:41.320
Pull the trigger

00:45:46.490 --> 00:45:47.990
"Psycho-Pass" refers to the measurement
of a person's mind and personality.

00:45:48.160 --> 00:45:49.740
This is a work of fiction. Any resemblance
to real persons or groups is coincidental.
